{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_12454d9f914ac15c638edc9d4253761c5e35eebbda588710d1574fff07b8d233","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"truffle-ai/dexto@a910e0ef36f2 snapshot 491bca189af9a968","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3fc2ae6f059a5ec1bb4cabf98a217b3ee0b8a71f20eb0ae1263a97e401b7a63c","slc_6d8a374ae86b1d285d3999a5c66053f0068348a9f84cf3998013549182e5047b","slc_af86c02fe34de5447c8ea2c49a73cd614c8f5ba59bfd8ae4ee4a17357f58fdf3"],"source_ids":["src_fcf32ae43a5657cab30fb11696cfa004"],"text":"Dexto offers multiple run modes: Web UI (default), interactive CLI, server mode exposing REST and SSE APIs, and MCP server mode over stdio, with Discord and Telegram example integrations.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_31e8311b2b737c28cba4a2577f43e6685ca21e8d51d38f8dbaaf32af4680c13b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"truffle-ai/dexto@a910e0ef36f2 snapshot 491bca189af9a968","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0a21da5fbd1463f9b6ba6bc6a1d67530da351b17d659c7b37c3724a4c5b18839","slc_d52fe6cb8b0d2928d92023e21acb7a7d8c3844b27f430d37a2e5776f3fdb0c21"],"source_ids":["src_fcf32ae43a5657cab30fb11696cfa004"],"text":"CLI options include -a/--agent, -m/--model, --auto-approve, --no-elicitation, --mode, and --port, plus commands such as setup, deploy, agents install/list, session management, and search.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3e95222a72fbf753b3aafddb2f48b83666992f303bb7c7ab8d59f847c1d55793","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"truffle-ai/dexto@a910e0ef36f2 snapshot 491bca189af9a968","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_36631f8291839e0275e9a74dedbf2a15ad9732abf7552c8c6a4aa40b3223af98","slc_52b47ab3ae147e5f24b6e5dc2a59d5ae5e9b468395ca9707846fff1fa82bb353","slc_9846787193ead0a6caa41b9e56a60ad0c9586d5ba1aa1e7cee8e5865748723c8"],"source_ids":["src_fcf32ae43a5657cab30fb11696cfa004"],"text":"Dexto is described as an agent harness that turns LLMs into reliable, stateful agents able to take actions, remember context, and recover from errors, with agents defined in YAML configuration files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4f2b947c1585d3d53ee5490d9a89c6af08f94c78f7f2be837efa98d6b61912fd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"truffle-ai/dexto@a910e0ef36f2 snapshot 491bca189af9a968","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0cf26b8363f6cb0e60a7af9caf347860e0833081523be1ce2375fc2f3f392800","slc_2c14127169cc65ba51e92a12f091aa1ae7b7c921b58fb6fccadc5834443bcc9c","slc_6932394e9e2b2de98ca4cf7af163b0de6482aea9494c822e4e84cb58010a6190"],"source_ids":["src_fcf32ae43a5657cab30fb11696cfa004"],"text":"The README states anonymous usage telemetry (commands used, execution time, errors, OS/Node info, models used) is collected and can be disabled by setting DEXTO_ANALYTICS_DISABLED=1.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_63bf9a110b9d95ea5ca829f4d44624f3815aa58ca91950c627e7cc0143188cb8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"truffle-ai/dexto@a910e0ef36f2 snapshot 491bca189af9a968","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7615bef636143399278f5bdf5fe5eb459f0180b42f11ce930ed5fe548acfb0a2","slc_9e5d7aec5757ef215b645bbf3dcc82ac5653b7f87ef658c766d848e69d06e206"],"source_ids":["src_fcf32ae43a5657cab30fb11696cfa004"],"text":"Agents can spawn sub-agents via an agent-spawner tool with configurable allowedAgents, maxConcurrentAgents, and timeout; sub-agents run ephemerally, clean up after completion, and forward tool approvals to the parent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1dde686dc03d478986814c01ea5587d0"}
